      <div class="quiz-card" id="q1">
        <div class="quiz-num">Question 1 of 5</div>
        <div class="quiz-question">Which of the following is a proposition?</div>
        <div class="quiz-options">
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(1,'A','D')"><div class="option-letter">A</div> "What is the value of π?"</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(1,'B','D')"><div class="option-letter">B</div> "Solve for x: 2x = 6"</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(1,'C','D')"><div class="option-letter">C</div> "x + y is greater than 5"</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(1,'D','D')"><div class="option-letter">D</div> "The square root of 9 is 3"</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q1-feedback"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-card" id="q2">
        <div class="quiz-num">Question 2 of 5</div>
        <div class="quiz-question">If p is True and q is False, what is the truth value of p → q?</div>
        <div class="quiz-options">
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(2,'A','B')"><div class="option-letter">A</div> True</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(2,'B','B')"><div class="option-letter">B</div> False</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(2,'C','B')"><div class="option-letter">C</div> True and False</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(2,'D','B')"><div class="option-letter">D</div> Cannot be determined</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q2-feedback"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-card" id="q3">
        <div class="quiz-num">Question 3 of 5</div>
        <div class="quiz-question">The contrapositive of "If it is sunny, then I go outside" is:</div>
        <div class="quiz-options">
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(3,'A','C')"><div class="option-letter">A</div> If I go outside, then it is sunny</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(3,'B','C')"><div class="option-letter">B</div> If it is not sunny, then I do not go outside</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(3,'C','C')"><div class="option-letter">C</div> If I do not go outside, then it is not sunny</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(3,'D','C')"><div class="option-letter">D</div> If it is sunny, then I do not go outside</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q3-feedback"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-card" id="q4">
        <div class="quiz-num">Question 4 of 5</div>
        <div class="quiz-question">Using De Morgan's Law, ¬(p ∨ q) is equivalent to:</div>
        <div class="quiz-options">
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(4,'A','B')"><div class="option-letter">A</div> ¬p ∨ ¬q</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(4,'B','B')"><div class="option-letter">B</div> ¬p ∧ ¬q</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(4,'C','B')"><div class="option-letter">C</div> p ∧ q</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(4,'D','B')"><div class="option-letter">D</div> p ∨ q</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q4-feedback"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-card" id="q5">
        <div class="quiz-num">Question 5 of 5</div>
        <div class="quiz-question">A compound proposition that is True for every possible truth value combination of its components is called a:</div>
        <div class="quiz-options">
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(5,'A','C')"><div class="option-letter">A</div> Contradiction</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(5,'B','C')"><div class="option-letter">B</div> Contingency</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(5,'C','C')"><div class="option-letter">C</div> Tautology</div>
          <div class="quiz-option" onclick="answer(5,'D','C')"><div class="option-letter">D</div> Converse</div>
        </div>
        <div class="quiz-feedback" id="q5-feedback"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-score-bar" id="score-bar">
